om/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":105,"digest":"sha256:9ad859f0a1308787f5cb1e2f9a261b337308f9e71ff64074640124cf901c7823","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-17T14:36:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T14:36:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.16/SHA256SUMS"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/assets/570442424","id":570442424,"node_id":"RA_kwDOUZPJh84iAEK4","name":"UPDATE.zh-CN.txt","label":"","uploader":{"login":"yinsn","id":102125674,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhZQag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102125674?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn","html_url":"https://github.com/yinsn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinsn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":1508,"digest":"sha256:a80562433cfa203b3399d41924270f9d29f785dbf12c0f7901b812d8cc16da5d","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-17T14:36:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T14:36:23Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/releases/download/v0.2.16/UPDATE.zh-CN.txt"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/tarball/v0.2.16","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yinsn/FreeJot-Updates/zipball/v0.2.16","body":"# 释手 0.2.16 · Claude 输入兼容修复\n\n构建：20260917-142815（UTC）\n\n## 本次改动\n\n- **Claude 粘贴兼容**：Claude 桌面端改用系统原生“粘贴”命令，避免 Code 输入框重复插入同一段听写。一次听写只发起一次粘贴；调用结果不确定时不自动重试。\n- **连续听写补标点**：兼容空编辑框上报占位长度的情况。核实实际编辑范围为空后建立位置记录，下一次连续听写时可补回前一句原有的句号或问号。\n- **沿用原有规则**：单句末尾不加标点或空格；手打或修改过的前文保守跳过。仍只在本机读取光标前的短文本，不增加模型调用或提示词。\n- **明确回填状态**：无法执行粘贴时显示“已复制，请在输入框粘贴”；调用结果不明确时提示文字已保留，不重复发送粘贴。\n\n本次不更换模型。更新保留本机模型、个人词典、听写历史和已保存设置。\n\n## 更新方法\n\n- **0.2.2 或更新版本**：打开「设置 → 关于释手 → 检查更新 → 下载并更新」。\n- **0.2.1 或更早版本**：下载本次轻量更新包，退出释手，运行包内的 `FreeJotUpdater.app`，选择原来的完整离线应用，可直接升级到 0.2.16。\n- **新 Mac 首次安装**：按[完整安装指南](https://yinsn.github.io/FreeJot-Updates/INSTALL.md)安装含模型的 0.2.4 完整包，再在应用内更新到 0.2.16。\n\n完成后在「关于释手」核对版本与构建号。\n"}